## License Summary

Adobe-GB1 mapping data is embedded in internal/cidmap. Source hashes and
generation instructions are in internal/cidmap/README.md and SHA256SUMS;
the full Adobe BSD-3-Clause notice is in internal/cidmap/NOTICE.
Other embedded Adobe CMaps retain their original notices in
internal/pdf2ofd/cmaps/adobe.zip.

The project uses the following license types:
- MIT: 56 packages
- BSD-3-Clause: 30 packages
- Apache-2.0: 7 packages
- Mixed MIT and Apache-2.0: 1 package
- BSD-2-Clause: 2 packages
- ISC: 1 package
- GPL-2.0-with-font-exception: 1 package (go-fonts/latin-modern - font package, not linked into binary)

All dependencies are compatible with the project's license.
